  // Phrases: regex rules for OSD labels that have no exact "overlay" entry (sensor and group names).
  // Matched case-insensitively ("(?-i)" at the start makes a pattern case-sensitive) and applied
  // longest pattern first; patterns of the same length run in the order listed, so list a specific
  // rule above a generic one of the same length. Text in double quotes (game names) is not translated.
  // Replacements are lowercase: the first letter of the result is capitalized afterwards, unless the
  // label starts in lower case, like the units "ms" and "min".
  // German compounds: a device prefix joins the noun with a hyphen ("GPU Core" -> "GPU-Kern").
